        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8937,
        "name": "执灯人",
        "desc": "<p>长久以来对抗着深渊永无休止的入侵与狂猎，守护着挪德卡莱的自由与和平的古老组织。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/01/326985891/104b05e9f5f33a148c1481c0e3246db2_4383350928096817374.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "尼基塔是现任执灯人的执灯长。他的前任是他的好友，",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8550,
        "name": "西格德",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/01/c9ca6be07ad8bd737297723b34f7910d_3878710260738765674.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 7
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": ".",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9123,
        "name": "叶洛亚",
        "desc": "调查分队「魇夜之莺」成员，执灯人最年轻的分队长。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/01/29/d585407867aa47b4d925613cea9f00c2_5864597966579326880.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "叶洛亚的父母死于狂猎之后，尼基塔便将他带到皮拉米达城，并视为自己的儿子抚养他长大。尼基塔派遣叶洛亚和他的小队，「魇夜之莺」前往苦壑崖附近消灭狂猎。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8398,
        "name": "菲林斯",
        "desc": "挪德卡莱的「执灯人」，看守着北方小岛上的灯塔与墓地。一位言行举止极富修养的神秘绅士。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/26/4ac47a285a0abaada08f3216bdd22b0e_7846853832529267058.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "执灯士和一位",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7626,
        "name": "妖精",
        "desc": "<p>她们是初代冰神，白沙皇的追随者，由巨兽的遗骸与倾落的霜月之光纺所创造。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/21/326985891/8bfe123477466c3c8a09fbff5702b087_5876833777990693498.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "。尼基塔是少数几个知道菲林斯真正身世的人之一。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
